### Weighings — UPDATE PATCH gross weight (expects 200 OK; lot stock adjusted)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grossWeightKg": 125
}

### Weighings — PATCH a lot of another material (expects 400 Bad Request)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/weighings/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "materialLotId": 2
}
